## 2. Trust boundaries

Changed code on untrusted-input paths, all validation kept:
- Item 1 (`validateOffsets*`): IPC read, C-data import, RecordBatch.init. Same accepted set, no early exit.
- Item 5 (reader reuse): see its section. Reuse only at ref count 1; decode caps checked before allocation.
